        },
        "effectiveDateTime": "2025-11-22",
        "valueString": "Denies chest pain, shortness of breath, palpitations, oedema, weight loss, fevers, night sweats, PR bleeding, melaena, and recent travel. Mood okay; no suicidal ideation."
