          "text": "Urinary symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "effectiveDateTime": "2025-11-22",
        "valueString": "Longstanding urgency and incontinence, stable with no new lower urinary tract symptoms. Mixed incontinence with urgency and small-volume leakage and some stress leakage; uses 3–4 pads/day. No retention symptoms; nocturia twice nightly. No dysuria, haematuria, loin pain, or fevers."
      }
    },
